  "content": {
    "id": "p51-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "For the circle $x^2+y^2=4$ and line $y=mx+4$, determine the exact values of the gradient, $m$, so that the line:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p51-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "is a tangent to the circle (intersects the circle once)",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m=\\pm\\sqrt{3}$.",
          "worked": "Substitute $y=mx+4$ into the circle equation.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+(mx+4)^2&=4\\\\(1+m^2)x^2+8mx+12&=0\\\\\\Delta&=(8m)^2-4(1+m^2)(12)\\\\&=16m^2-48\\end{align*}$$\nFor a tangent, $\\Delta=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}16m^2-48&=0\\\\m^2&=3\\\\m&=\\pm\\sqrt{3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 64
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "intersects the circle at two points",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m<-\\sqrt{3}$ or $m>\\sqrt{3}$.",
          "worked": "For two points of intersection, $\\Delta>0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}16m^2-48&>0\\\\m^2&>3\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $m<-\\sqrt{3}$ or $m>\\sqrt{3}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p51-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "does not intersect the circle",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\sqrt{3}<m<\\sqrt{3}$.",
          "worked": "For no points of intersection, $\\Delta<0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}16m^2-48&<0\\\\m^2&<3\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $-\\sqrt{3}<m<\\sqrt{3}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      }
    ]
  },
